cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SITool v2.0 in your research, please cite the software using the metadata below."
title: "Sea Ice Evaluation Tool (SITool) v2.0"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
abstract: >-
  SITool v2.0 is a Python-based, process-oriented evaluation toolkit for
  polar sea-ice simulations and CMIP-like model output. It integrates
  diagnostics for sea-ice concentration, drift, thickness, snow depth,
  concentration and mass budgets, and seasonal transition dates in a
  configurable workflow with parallel execution and HTML reporting.
authors:
